# Documentation site rules

- This repository is a MkDocs site. Write in British English.
- Build with `mkdocs build --strict` and fix every warning before you finish.
- One H1 per page; headings in sentence case.
- Images go in `docs/assets/` and every image needs alt text.
- Do not rename existing pages: other sites link to them. Add a redirect in `mkdocs.yml` if you must move one.
- The generated `site/` folder is build output: do not read or edit it, run `mkdocs build` instead.
